{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9d6bbd32-42e8-8be1-b0b1-21d97a24fef8",
  "created_at": "2025-12-24T10:05:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Frank Mancini",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:01:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth. Merry Christmas Eve, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:02:04-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Beth, and a Merry Christmas to you as well. My name is Frank Mancini. I am calling to ask about the walking path along the shore. I understand a portion of it may be closed, and I would like to know whether that is so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:02:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sure, Mr. Mancini. Which path are you thinking of? We have a few that run along the water near the beaches."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:02:31-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The one that goes along the beach park, past the pavilion and the parking area. I walk it with my grandson when he visits. We went Sunday and there was a sawhorse and a sign, and I could not make out what the sign said without my other glasses."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:02:49-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yep, that sounds like the section near the beach that's been fenced off for repair work. Let me pull up the notice so I give you the right information. Bear with me one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:03:02-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. Take your time. I am in no hurry this morning. [pause] I do apologize, my grandson is beside me drawing on the back of an envelope, and he keeps showing me his work. It appears to be a very large dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:03:18-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, tell him it's a great dog. Okay, so I'm seeing that the stretch past the pavilion is closed for now, and the rest of the path is open. You can walk from the main entrance up to the pavilion, you just can't go through the far section."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:03:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. And is there any word on when the far section might open again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:03:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The notice just says until the work is finished, so no firm date. With the holiday and the weather, I wouldn't count on it this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:03:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is understandable. Kindly tell me, is there a web page that has this same information? My daughter could look at it for me, as I am not much of a hand with the computer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:04:05-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is. If you go to the city website and look under Recreation, there's a section for park and beach updates. Closures get posted there. Or she can just search the city name and parks closures and it should come up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:04:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation, and then park and beach updates. Let me repeat that to be certain. Recreation, then park and beach updates."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:04:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. And if it's not posted for some reason, you can always call us back and we'll tell you what we know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:04:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is very kind of you. He says to tell you the dog's name is Biscuit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:04:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Biscuit! Love it. Well, you two enjoy the open part of the path, and have a wonderful Christmas."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:04:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Beth. You have been most helpful. Good day to you, and happy holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:04:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Mancini. Bye now."
    }
  ],
